[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "智代子、結果が――",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001050010,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん！　三次審査、どうでしたか！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000105/7010001050010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うおっ……落ち着け、智代子\r\n三次審査は無事通過したぞ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001050020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "よ……良かったぁ……\r\n突破できたんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000105/7010001050020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001050030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私、やっぱりチョコアイドルをやめなくて良かったです！\r\n……って、都合が良すぎですかね？　えへへ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000105/7010001050030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことはない\r\nたくさん悩んだから、今の智代子があるんだ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "チョコアイドルとして迷いがなくなったからこそ、\r\nファンも増えて通過できたのかもな",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001050040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい、そうだったら嬉しいです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000105/7010001050040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001050050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "やっぱり、ファンのみんなって、\r\n私のことちゃんと見てくれてるんですねっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000105/7010001050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、智代子が頑張ってるから\r\nみんな応援したくなるんだ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001050060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……ふふっ、アイドル活動って最高です！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000105/7010001050060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001050070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "頑張ったことが認めてもらえて\r\nファンのみんなのおかげでステージに立てて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000105/7010001050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001050080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん\r\n私、まだまだ先に進みたいです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000105/7010001050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001050090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ここで終わってもいいなんて思えません\r\n絶対、『W.I.N.G.』に出場したいです……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000105/7010001050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、俺も智代子が『W.I.N.G.』のステージに\r\n立つ姿が見たいよ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001050100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ありがとうございます。私、絶対に立ってみせます！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000105/7010001050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001050110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "だから……\r\nプロデューサーさんも付き合ってくれると嬉しいです！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000105/7010001050110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん。断るわけないだろ\r\n一緒に、『W.I.N.G.』へ行こう！",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001050120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！\r\n頑張りましょうね、プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000105/7010001050120"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]